id: evil-saiyan-overwhelming-evil-power
name: Overwhelming Evil Power
order: 3
slot: burst
description: >
  The insatiable evil urges mixes with your Saiyan battle lust to drive you into a frenzy.
text: >
  Overwhelming Evil Power: The insatiable evil urges mixes with your Saiyan battle lust to drive you into a frenzy.
  (1)-[Triggered/Transform]: Enter the Surging State until the end of your turn. If you do, maximize your Evil Points.

---

# Burst Limit: the Surging State till the end of your turn, and the Evil Points at their most.
[triggered/transform, 1/encounter, effect 1]
enterState(surging, 1, turn);
evilpoints.stacks += 99;
